updated_at: "2026-11-19T02:09:02.004Z"
author: codex-ops272-1114
comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-14T21:59:48.191Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Orient and start the authorized fleet rollout. Verified released v2026.11.14 at 7687a35d7522482bd8361d60dbc2589e9afbc81c. Preserve this package approval, schedule, preparation and publication hooks through canonical inputs. The merged Jira pilot proves cross-repository npm identity acceptance; this package must still pass its own first-run preflight. Run caller contracts, installed attestation, strict YAML, actionlint and regenerated changelog checks. Shared-runner hold gates every push. No review-thread action, merge, dispatch or publication."
  "2026-11-14T22:10:49.912Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Rolled the Jira pilot contract into this package: released workflow pin 7687a35d7522482bd8361d60dbc2589e9afbc81c (v2026.11.14), exact pm-ops 2026.11.14 validator, explicit include-empty changelog generation/check/notes hooks, and declared yaml for caller tests. Preserved package-owned approval, schedule and preparation inputs. Focused gates passed 7/7, zero failures/skips; linked caller test passed 6/6 in a scratch pm project to avoid tracker run artifacts. Reverting only release.yml to the old copy in a disposable fixture failed 5 of 6 contracts. Actionlint passed 1/1, strict workflow/Dependabot YAML parsing 2/2, installed publish-attestation passed 1/1. Regenerate changelog and check after this final tracker write. Full npm/Bun certification remains with CI; no full local pass is claimed. Cross-repository npm OIDC evidence is Jira run 43639146392, recorded on pm-ops#272; first package activation must still pass its preflight. Every push waits on the shared-runner hold. No merge, dispatch, publication or review-thread action. Leave this item open and release only this author claim."
  "2026-11-19T02:04:20.701Z",codex-sol,"Daily Release candidate PR #40 for 2026.10.29 failed with Live publication identity disagrees. npm published at 2026-11-16T08:36:34.512Z before trusted preparation at 2026-11-17T12:04:08Z. No attestation, tag, GitHub Release or recorded workflow publication attempt exists for this intent. The protected merge matches the receipt. Read-only replay at c46a241 returns occupied and retains the historical receipt on retirement. Pin the shared workflow to v2026.11.18 with existing inputs and permissions."
  "2026-11-19T02:09:02.004Z",codex-sol,The linked release caller contract and changelog check both passed. Rollout is pending review and scheduled reconciliation.
